will determine if the resolution of the conflict of interest is fair and
reasonable to us and our shareholders. However, we cannot assure you that this
committee will successfully eliminate the conflicts of interests that will exist
between us and Hines, or reduce the risks related thereto.



     Specifically, the conflicts committee is responsible for reviewing and
