conditions, and the NY Trust Institutional Investors will participate in such
acquisition on similar terms as those upon which the initial assets were
acquired. A separate real estate investment trust substantially similar to NY
Trust will be formed to acquire the asset with the NY Trust Institutional
Investors, the Core Fund and a Hines affiliate holding shares therein in the
same proportions as they hold shares in NY Trust. This property is also an
office property located in New York City. Please see "-- Manhattan Tower."



     As of the date of this prospectus, the Core Fund holds 23.98% of the
outstanding shares in NY Trust, the NY Trust Institutional Investors own 51% of
the outstanding shares in NY Trust, Sumitomo Life owns 24.5% of the outstanding
