as soon as the Core Fund has raised sufficient third party equity to fund such
repayment or, if sufficient third party equity is not so raised, no later than
December 31, 2004 using capital contributed by Hines.



     The outstanding principal amount of the mezzanine loan bears interest at
LIBOR plus an applicable margin. The applicable margin for LIBOR loans ranges
from 3.75% to 6.25% (currently 3.75%).



     The mezzanine loan agreement contains covenants which are parallel to the
covenants contained in the mortgage loan agreement.



